{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>- DRAWING XXX REV XX DATED XX<br>- USE [SHIFT]+[ENTER] FOR REGULAR LINE SPACING<br>- USE [ENTER] FOR LARGER LINE SPACING</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed development shall achieve security standards (based on Secured by Design principles) to the satisfaction of the local authority &amp;amp; Metropolitan Police, details of which shall be provided to the Local Planning Authority for its written approval prior to the first occupation of the approved development. All security measures applied to the approved development shall be permanently retained thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to first use of the site details of signage shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The approved signage shall be implemented and thereafter retained for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed retail unit must remain in ancillary use to the main community centre for the lifetime of the development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The hours of operation shall remain between :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;8am-7pm Monday to Friday&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;9am- 5pm Saturday&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;11am-4pm Sunday&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to first use of the site a detailed scheme of improvement works to the front elevation of the site shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Improvement works shall include but not limited to repainting, replacing windows and doors, removal of awning and redundant signage/posters and replacement of roller shutters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The approved scheme shall be implemented and retained thereafter for the lifetime of the development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
